<p>
  Each ingredient delivers meaningful gains. The task-completion objective alone is worth +21 points on GSM8K. Adding PrefixLM adds another +21 on DROP. Switching to HRM adds +7–9 points across reasoning benchmarks. The combination is multiplicative — all three are needed.
</p>
</section>

