<h2>Competitive Performance at 100–900× Lower Cost</h2>
<p>
  After the ablation confirms all three ingredients are needed, the final HRM-Text 1B checkpoint is compared against contemporary models — trained with dramatically larger budgets. The comparison reveals a consistent pattern: HRM-Text achieves near-competitive performance on reasoning-heavy benchmarks (MATH, GSM8K, DROP, ARC-C) while trailing on broad factual-knowledge benchmarks (MMLU), which benefit from trillion-token data breadth.
</p>

